{"ID":"20240205153901-fq2gyc1","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153901-fq2gyc1","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153901-fq2gyc1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206134926-jwrdkof\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611155552-yb0oyyv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:3782,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240625090044-lahr8c8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"182白鲜皮（白藓皮）","type":"doc","updated":"20240815161644"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206134926-jwrdkof","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206134926-jwrdkof","updated":"20240206134941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产河北、山东、辽宁等地。\n【性状】\t白鲜根皮呈卷筒状，长515cm，直径12cm，厚2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5mm。外表面灰白色或淡灰黄色，具细纵皱纹及细根痕，常有突起的颗粒状小点；内表面类白色，有细纵纹。质脆，折断时有粉尘飞扬，断面不平坦，略呈层片状，剥去外层，对光可见闪烁的小亮点。有羊膻气，味微苦。\n【性味】\t苦、咸，寒。\n【功效】\t清热燥湿；祛风止痒；解毒。主治风热湿毒所致的风疹；湿疹；疥癣；黄疸；湿热痹。"}]},{"ID":"20240206134929-cqzs6gr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206134929-cqzs6gr","updated":"20240206134929"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206134929-j1s426o.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205155439-62qsagx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205155439-62qsagx","updated":"20240205155439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白鲜皮"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白鲜皮-20240205155439-yheafys.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240815155841-fbj3bbx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240815155841-fbj3bbx","updated":"20240815155841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 473px;","style":"width: 463px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白鲜皮"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白鲜皮-20240815155744-p3zje7d.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 463px;\" parent-style=\"width: 473px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240815155919-6iw6cb7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240815155919-6iw6cb7","updated":"20240815155919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 424px;","style":"width: 414px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白鲜皮2-20240625085505-ebvyl9f"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白鲜皮2-20240625085505-ebvyl9f-20240625085806-nk5rsah.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 414px;\" parent-style=\"width: 424px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 473px;","style":"width: 463px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白鲜皮6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白鲜皮6-20240625085701-s63bi3k.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 463px;\" parent-style=\"width: 473px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240815160023-ed0m3oo","Type":"N